  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13.33px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"CA\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: black;\">(8 fotos) El Bus de la llengua, promogut per la Conselleria d&rsquo;Educaci&oacute;, Investigaci&oacute;, Cultura i Esport, i en coordinaci&oacute; amb l&#39;&agrave;</span><span lang=\"CA\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"><font color=\"#00000a\">rea de Normalitzaci&oacute; Ling&uuml;&iacute;stica que gestiona e</font></span><span lang=\"CA\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: black;\">l tinent d&rsquo;alcalde Llu&iacute;s Pastor Catalan, ha arribat aquest dimarts a Onda i durant dos dies promocionar&agrave; el valenci&agrave; entre l&#39;alumnat de 4t i 5&eacute; de Prim&agrave;ria. </span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/lluispastorcatalanitecniquesmunicipalsbusllenguaonda.jpg\" alt=\"lluispastorcatalanitecniquesmunicipalsbusllenguaonda\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/p1018026.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/p1018030.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/p1018032.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/p1018033.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/busdelallenguaonda/p1018034.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-